msgstr "Notre équipe d’assistance a confié l’établissement à {email}. Vous faites toujours partie de l’équipe, en tant que gérant de toutes les succursales."

#: src/support/support-accounts.service.ts:374
msgid "Our support team made you the owner. You can now change the team, the payout number and everything else. The old owner is still in the team as a manager — keep them or take them out under Team."
